WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.584
A factor divides a number into equal groups without a remainder. Multiplication and

00:00:05.584 --> 00:00:07.240
division are inverse operations.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:14.762
How many groups of 2 are in 18? The answer is 9. 18 divided by 2 equals 9; 2 is a

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:15.711
factor of 18.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:21.926
A teacher during a sports day arranges 27 objects in 9 equal rows. How many objects

00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:24.960
are in each row? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:31.472
A teacher during a sports day arranges 27 objects in 9 equal rows. How many objects

00:00:31.472 --> 00:00:38.583
are in each row? The answer is 3. 27 divided by 9 equals 3; 9 is a factor of 27.
